---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Hoosier Watchdogs"
	description="Independent, document-based investigative reporting on power in Indiana."
	pubDate={new Date('August 17 2026')}
	heroImage="/hw-hero-logo.png"
>
	<div class="hw-container">
		<p class="hw-lead">
			<strong>Hoosier Watchdogs</strong> is an independent investigative project focused on power in Indiana: 
			state government, local politics, universities, police, prosecutors, and the donor networks that shape them.
		</p>

		<h2>Our Mission</h2>
		<p>
			We publish investigative work that local outlets won’t touch: state corruption, donor capture, 
			university complicity, surveillance, and the national money behind it. Hoosier Watchdogs publishes 
			through <strong>Muncie Voice</strong>, an independent outlet with a global audience.
		</p>

		<h2>Core Principles</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Document-Driven:</strong> Built on public records, FOIA responses, court filings, contracts, and data.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Unpaid & Independent:</strong> No corporate or foundation funding, and no access deals.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Local Focus, National Scope:</strong> We use Indiana as a lens on oligarchy, surveillance, 
				election infrastructure, foreign-policy capture, and the corruption of the "rules-based order."
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Contribute & Pitch</h2>
		<p>
			We welcome contributions from journalists who want to work with primary sources, keep their bylines, 
			and build a portfolio of adversarial reporting.
		</p>
		<p>
			Have a tip or a document-based pitch? Reach out to us directly at:
			<br />
			<a href="mailto:hoosierwatchdogs@proton.me" class="hw-email-link">hoosierwatchdogs@proton.me</a>
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	:root {
		--hw-purple: #3B2358;
		--hw-orange: #D9531E;
		--hw-bg: #FAF8F5;
		--hw-text: #1A1A1A;
	}

	.hw-container {
		color: var(--hw-text);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.hw-lead {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		border-left: 4px solid var(--hw-orange);
		padding-left: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	h2 {
		color: var(--hw-purple);
		margin-top: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	ul {
		list-style-type: square;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}

	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	li strong {
		color: var(--hw-purple);
	}

	.hw-email-link {
		color: var(--hw-orange);
		font-weight: bold;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.hw-email-link:hover {
		color: var(--hw-purple);
	}
</style>

